리 지구 우리가 지켜요<span style=\"padding-right:0.2em;\">\"</span>”</a>, 《제주환경일보》, 2021. 11. 28.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=%EC%A0%9C%EC%A3%BC%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD%EC%9D%BC%EB%B3%B4&amp;rft.atitle=%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%EC%A7%81%EC%9E%A5%EC%9D%B8%EB%B4%89%EC%82%AC%EB%8B%A8%2C+%22%EC%9A%B0%EB%A6%AC+%EC%A7%80%EA%B5%AC+%EC%9A%B0%EB%A6%AC%EA%B0%80+%EC%A7%80%EC%BC%9C%EC%9A%94%22&amp;rft.chron=2021.+11.+28.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newsje.com%2Fnews%2FarticleView.html%3Fidxno%3D247669&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3AGreen+Earth+%28%EB%8F%84%EC%8B%9C%C2%B7%EC%82%B0%EB%A6%BC+%EC%A0%95%ED%99%94%29+%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span>\n</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://news4trafford.co.uk/2021/12/21/mayor-of-trafford-mark-dale-asez-wao-help-clean-up-old-trafford/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"Mayor of Trafford, Trafford Council’s Mark Dale &amp; ASEZ WAO help clean up Old Trafford,\"</a> <i>News4trafford</i>, Dec. 21. 2021.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.kiro7.com/news/local/volunteers-clean-up-more-than-400-pounds-garbage-burien-park/YWT66MEVLBD3ZDMZXJX6OLFGZQ/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"Volunteers clean up more than 400 pounds of garbage at Burien park,\"</a> <i>KIRO 7 News Seattle</i>, Dec. 20. 2021.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-10\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/volun